<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32475" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">olfacto</span></b> , āvi, ātum,
		1, v. freq. a.
		olfacio, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to smell at</i> any thing (ante-class. and
			post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vestimentum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Men. 1, 2, 56</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">membrana olfactata,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					28, 16, 63, § 225</span></i>
			 (al. olefacta): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pulei ramum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					20, 14, 54, § 155</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>to smell</i>, <i>snuff</i>, <i>detect</i>, <i>perceive</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">boves caelum olfactantes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					18, 35, 88, § 364</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
